# title: Floating-strike lookback call
# category: Asians, lookbacks and ladders
# underlyings: 1
# source: Goldman, Sosin & Gatto, Path Dependent Options: Buy at the Low, Sell at the High, Journal of Finance, 1979
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Buy at the lowest close of the year: pays the final price minus the minimum close.
#
# The minimum is taken over every daily close from the strike date on.

2027-01-04
    lo = spot()

schedule(2027-01-05, 2027-12-30, 1D, US, F)
    lo = min(lo, spot())

2028-01-04
    lo = min(lo, spot())
    pays spot() - lo
